WEBVTT

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.990
Yay! Look at all the snow!

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:13.890
Ready for reload.

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:14.610
Got it!

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:18.310
You really gotta have a 
horn when building a robot.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:20.670
If you're going to decorate it,

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.720
why not use a Christmas theme?

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.340
Nice idea!

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:25.800
But of course.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.930
Which of you are responsible?!

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:31.780
Ugh, it's a yeti!

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:33.880
Let's retreat! At top speed!

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:35.760
Run away!

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:36.720
Stop right there!

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:42.180
Nina-chan, morning!

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:44.800
Morning, Lion-san.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.560
Can you get me a weapon?

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.150
A weapon?

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:51.530
Be careful.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:57.360
Thanks!

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.640
Use my power to your heart's content.

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:10.500
Now then, I know it's almost winter break.

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:14.420
And of course, that means term finals.

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:19.470
Our practical exam this 
term will be a tournament.

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:23.170
Please consult the bulletin board for 
tournament pairings

00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:25.060
and the areas to be covered 
on the written tests.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:25.980
Okay.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.230
Miss Fujisaki, there isn't going 
to be a school announcement?

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:34.190
Due to the acciden—I mean, unforeseen 
circumstances during our last broadcast,

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:35.890
we won't be having an 
announcement this time.

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:37.250
Oh...

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:38.820
Too bad.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:41.700
That "almost there" 
feeling wasn't half bad.

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:47.620
I really wanted to do that announcement.

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:48.940
Goodness gracious.

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:50.870
We've already stepped down,

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:53.420
so it's time to leave 
things to our juniors.

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:54.630
But that's exactly why.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:58.440
I was thinking of doing something like 
hijacking it and proposing.

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:03.190
I wonder what the first-years 
are doing for their practical.

00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:05.040
I heard it was a tournament.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:08.020
Is that right? That'll be tough.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:11.830
Their strength in battle will 
be clearly ranked after a tournament.

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:13.600
And that...

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.840
has a direct relation to the
 value a Logicalist has.

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:24.660
So I'm gonna be fighting...

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:27.990
What? I'm fighting our mistress?!

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:30.670
Karen, you should be more concerned about 
your written exam than your practical.

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:32.920
So that's where the true enemy lies!

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:35.500
Nina

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:35.500
Liones

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.670
You're up against a tough 
opponent from the get-go.

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:42.130
Oh, Nina. Came to take a look, too?

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:46.360
Nina-chan! What'll we 
do? We're gonna fight.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:48.850
What will we do? What else?

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:51.130
I won't hold back.

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:54.010
Got it! I'll give it my all, too!

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:10.530
Aren't you cold?

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:16.380
Principal, I've come here 
because I have a request.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.790
I don't care what kind of mission it is.

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:22.420
Please give me a chance to 
go on a mission.

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:27.010
In the past, it seemed as though 
some incident occurred every day.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.280
Even though the world is at peace now,

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:33.020
I think there are still lots of 
opportunities where I can prove the value of my powers.

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.520
But... if things keep 
going the way they are...

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:40.820
Do you hate it here?

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:43.790
I like it now.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:48.080
But there's something I have to do.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.350
More importantly,

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:53.670
I take great pride in the time I spent 
as a Logicalist protecting our world.

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:01.370
I will rank first in all 
of this terms finals,

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:03.730
both practical and written.

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:06.250
I'll even compete in exams 
for upper-year classes.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:07.220
So please...

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:10.140
give me a chance to go back to ALCA.

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:15.750
Whether it be cold or hot...

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:20.940
That which goes round will 
never be far out of reach.

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:26.810
Can you see the flame that's 
been lit inside you?

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:30.890
Yes. That's right.

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:35.330
It's not something you 
can see in yourself.

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:44.070
And yet, you'll still come across those 
who'll give you that precious fire.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:01.230
Reserved

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.230
This late?

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:07.850
What's the matter?

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:09.830
I can tell from your 
sword that you're scared.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:21.110
You really are a mouse.

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.340
I really can't do it.

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:28.840
Am I really gonna get 
stronger at this rate?

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:30.180
You will.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.190
Lion, as soon as you learn 
to control yourself,

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:36.700
you'll be a top-class 
Logicalist right away,

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:39.310
even when compared to 
those on active duty.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.520
You're just like I was.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:44.150
You used to be strong?

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.170
I don't believe that part was past tense.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:49.630
I have the same qualities you do.

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:50.370
Huh?

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:53.370
Extremely strong, such that it's a burden.

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:55.370
Wha?!

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:59.130
That's why everyone forced 
me into being your coach.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.410
So then if you Trance with Waffle-chan,

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:05.630
will you talk funny like me?

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.510
I'll be sure to make today's lesson
 even harder than usual.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:16.890
Reserved

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:14.710
I'd rather not!

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:24.420
Nina-chan, Nina-chan.

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:26.030
Can you teach me just this part?

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:29.220
How many "just this parts" 
have I taught you today?

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:34.640
Just so you know, I really am only asking 
you about parts I don't understand.

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:39.030
Which part?

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.920
Here! Question four.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:45.200
Can't you solve it the same way
 as the last question I showed you?

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:48.100
I can? Thanks, Nina-chan!

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:51.100
That's something you have to learn 
to think through on your own.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:05.810
Hey, you were in the 
training hall earlier, weren't you?

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:07.990
Huh?

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:12.270
What were you doing? With Miss Kagura.

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:14.150
Um...

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.990
Belle, I know.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:21.100
Um, after-school detention?

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:25.510
It's like, I guess there's a lot 
about me that's not working out.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.300
I see.

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:34.350
Nina-chan?

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:37.220
Nina! Teach me too!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:39.560
My mistress has her hands full with Karen.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.260
I would be grateful if you 
could tutor me as well.

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:42.910
The second semester's 
covered so much stuff,

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:45.060
there's no way I can cram 
it all in one night!

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.020
What part?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.150
Question seven.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.360
I don't get the parts I don't get!

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:05.010
Nina-san's concentrating.

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:07.060
Today is the day of the 
practical exam, after all.

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:08.580
You're right.

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:11.520
I am to take first this 
time, just like her.

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:13.610
I won't be losing to you!

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:15.590
I'm not gonna lose either!

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:36.940
Do your best, Waffle-chan!

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:40.060
<i>Do your best, Lion-chan!</i>

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:58.600
Don't worry. You're strong.

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:03.230
<i>Yeah! I'll save you!</i>

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:19.800
Nina-chan, I know I might not 
have a chance against you,

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:21.660
but I'm still gonna give it my all!

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:23.750
Let's do our best.

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:25.500
Lion-san.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:28.000
<i>You two.</i>

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:31.980
<i>I'd like you to fight to 
the best of your abilities.</i>

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:34.760
<i>The first round 
of our practical exam starts...</i>

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:35.970
<i>Now!</i>

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:52.610
Wha?

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:57.610
Let's go.

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:06.160
Trance Change.

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:19.640
I can do it if I try!

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.430
I'm surprised to see Nina-san struggle.

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:25.800
She kinda doesn't seem like herself.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:34.320
Don't tell me you've been hiding 
your strength all this time?

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:36.740
What do you mean?

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:38.070
Trance Change!

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.160
Don't play dumb!

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.370
N-Nina-chan!

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:50.480
Trance Change!

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.140
<i>Why?</i>

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:01.090
I won't hold back.

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:05.430
<i>I don't quite understand. 
But this is an exam.</i>

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:08.060
<i>So it's only proper...</i>

00:11:08.340 --> 00:11:09.140
<i>that I give it my all.</i>

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:12.330
Do you pity me?

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:13.020
What?

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.480
Logic Drive!

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:19.070
L-Logic Drive!

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.290
Nina-san! Lion-san!

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.500
They just hit at the same time.

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:35.190
They both still have their 
Protective Shields still up.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:44.280
Nina-chan, are you okay?

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:47.680
We're still in the middle of our match!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:50.390
S-Sorry. But...

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:53.310
I just kinda got worried.

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:56.690
I don't need your pity.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:58.130
I'm not pitying you!

00:11:58.130 --> 00:12:00.230
You just looked like you were struggling.

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:02.150
That's pity!

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:05.800
But! But! Who wouldn't be worried 
when their friend is struggling?

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:07.010
Friend?

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:09.280
Even though you're keeping secrets?

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:10.000
Huh?

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:13.200
That's not a friend to me!

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:26.390
Lion-san?

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:31.560
Wha?

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:38.060
<i>Are you the one who hurt Lion?</i>

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:52.910
Look out!

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:56.050
She can't even recognize Belle?

00:12:56.050 --> 00:13:00.660
Miss Kagura, she looks quite a bit like 
how she did when she first Tranced.

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:02.340
No, this is even worse.

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:04.240
Lion-san!

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:05.510
Lion! Get a hold of yourself!

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:06.500
Lion!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:07.510
Lion!

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:08.890
Lion-san!

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:12.020
Lion!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:13.980
Lion!

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:26.920
What am I...?

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:28.970
I'm sorry.

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:30.950
I'm sorry!

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.210
Lion!

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:33.450
<i>You.</i>

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:37.700
<i>You have no right to call her name.</i>

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:08.400
Ya-chan, how's it looking?

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:09.870
I can't spot her!

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:13.010
Where did you go, Lion?

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:15.200
Miss Kagura, Lion-san is...

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.490
I'll go after her.

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:19.880
Fujisaki, I want you to 
contact the principal.

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:20.660
Understood!

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:22.000
I'll help, too!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:22.760
Me too!

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:23.940
Me too!

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:28.050
Nina. Don't worry about things too much.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.170
Huh?

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:31.860
Lion's the one who lost 
balance using her Trance.

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:33.030
You can leave the rest—

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:34.110
No!

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:36.580
That's not it.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.310
I'll go find her.

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:47.250
I've been told that Belle 
keeps Lion's emotions under control

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:50.290
and that she has the power 
to restore her emotional balance.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:55.660
Understood. I'll take her with me.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:58.730
<i>Fujisaki and I will follow later.</i>

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:00.030
<i>Don't do anything reckless.</i>

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:10.710
Is that Lion's power?

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:27.030
Lion!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:31.940
Lion!

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:36.830
Just bear with this for a little bit.

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.480
Trance Change!

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:51.420
Logic Drive!

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:58.040
Trance Change!

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:00.660
Just a little more...

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:05.190
A little more...

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.750
I'm fine. Lion...

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.280
Lion has it even worse.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:21.190
Lion!

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:46.070
Belle! Do it!

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:15.840
Please...

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:19.680
Wake... wake up!

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:21.090
Lion!

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.310
Nina-chan?

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:37.880
Sorry. I'm sorry, Nina-chan. Sorry.

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:43.450
No. That's not it. That's not it at all.

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:46.620
The one who's in the wrong here is me.

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:50.890
I'm sorry, Lion.

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:53.880
I didn't mean to say what I did.

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:58.520
Don't cry! It is I who is in the wrong.

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:01.700
"It is I?" You don't talk that way.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:04.390
U-Um, well...

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:07.430
Just be yourself.

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:11.830
Yeah. I'm me.

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:17.810
What a relief.

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:25.790
Nina-chan?

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:28.370
Nina-chan!

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:35.260
Nina-chan.

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:37.120
I have done you wrong.

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:40.680
No, no, no! I...

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:43.170
I have to do something about this!

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:48.400
What direction is the school?

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:50.800
If I don't do something...

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:56.820
You'll lend me your power?

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:01.780
Let's go!

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:15.670
<i>I, Belle, swear to offer 
my Logic to Liones Yelistratova.</i>

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:22.180
I, Liones Yelistratova, swear 
to offer my Logic to Belle.

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.680
<i>I'm sure you're more than capable now.</i>

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:32.150
Trance!

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:58.280
What's this?

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:03.470
Nina-chan, does it hurt?

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:07.940
No.

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:10.980
Thank you, Lion.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:23.280
Staff Room

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:24.610
The first year practical 
exam has been cancelled.

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:29.040
This year's marks will be calculated 
based on your performance from normal lectures.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:30.430
I'm sorry.

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:35.420
As well, things being as they are, 
we will have to report this to ALCA.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:38.540
Miss Fujisaki, Lion isn't at fault here.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:40.370
I will tell them all the details,

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:42.410
but ALCA is the one who will decide fault.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:46.700
I'm sure it'll take some time until they 
decide how they'll deal with the problem.

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:48.100
It may be decided 
by the end of winter break,

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.640
or it may take even longer.

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:51.190
Right.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:53.060
Finally...

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:56.630
I'm really so happy 
that you're both safe.

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:04.960
You both get a gold star.

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:16.540
I'm sorry, Nina-chan.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.600
Why do you keep apologizing?

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:22.420
Because I promised I'd support you, but...

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:26.770
Nina-chan, you want 
to go back to ALCA, right?

00:21:26.770 --> 00:21:29.860
But once they report 
what happened here today...

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:34.710
I'm not supporting you at all.
I'm just getting in your way.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:37.300
So I'm sorry.

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:42.190
Today I learned a lesson.

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:44.970
That I've still got a long way to go.

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:48.110
So don't apologize anymore.

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:49.320
Lion.

00:21:52.850 --> 00:21:53.620
Lion?

00:21:55.430 --> 00:21:56.630
Excuse me.

00:21:57.400 --> 00:21:58.620
Lion-san.

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:03.830
I like just Lion better.

00:22:11.650 --> 00:22:12.430
Lion.

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:17.240
Nina-chan!

00:22:26.040 --> 00:22:26.990
Gosh.

00:22:33.230 --> 00:22:37.280
<i>It has been many months and years</i>

00:22:37.280 --> 00:22:41.040
<i>That I have been separated from my world</i>

00:22:41.310 --> 00:22:45.360
<i>But what I wish for</i>

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:48.930
<i>Never changes</i>

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:53.390
<i>If you take my hand, you'll hear it</i>

00:22:53.390 --> 00:22:58.540
<i>In a gentle voice</i>

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:03.230
<i>As long as we want to 
stay close to one another</i>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:07.250
<i>Then I don't need any prayers</i>

00:23:07.250 --> 00:23:09.210
<i>When you smile</i>

00:23:09.210 --> 00:23:15.350
<i>I can tell what's in your heart</i>

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:19.330
<i>That which is beautiful</i>

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:22.410
<i>And even the voice of the world</i>

00:23:22.410 --> 00:23:26.630
<i>Echo within our hearts</i>

00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:33.290
<i>Our wish to live side by side</i>

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Episode 10

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Our Tears Are Not For Our Own Benefit
